# This repo lives on a Windows drive accessed from WSL, so editors can silently
# rewrite LF -> CRLF and produce whole-file "diffs" that are pure line-ending
# churn (e.g. demos/08_schwarzschild/main.js showing 1483 changed lines that
# vanish under `git diff --ignore-all-space`). Force LF in the repo for all text
# so that never shows up as a change again.
* text=auto eol=lf
